---

SurfingNeo-OS is an open-source real-time visualization dashboard for agentic
AI networks. It connects Knowledge Base, API Brain, Secondary Brain, FinSurfing,
and Prompt Engineering platforms into a unified live mesh — with graceful
degradation when upstream services are unavailable.

Project: https://github.com/surfingalien/SurfingNeo-OS
